      "title": "Time-to-result interval analysis",
      "content": "Automated pipeline computing three timing intervals from actual timestamps in the MATSUlab discourse graph: (1) issue creation to claim (page_created to claimed_timestamp), (2) issue creation to first result (page_created to earliest RES node created date), (3) claim to first result (claimed_timestamp to earliest RES node). All intervals use a unified page-creation origin for the swimmer plot visualization.",
